#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:3
#: f363463e9e3a45af805929b03e734b4f
msgid "全局空位（Global Vacancy）"
msgstr "Global Vacancy"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:5
#: 39ff4b99ba984858b7dbd4ac74cbbe3b
msgid "**分类：** 缺陷"
msgstr "**Category:** Defects"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:7
#: 1b7b360a4f5b4c9c9568125a30363ea3
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:9
#: 2ae29ad76bd64ce9866fbacd1b54cb90
msgid "从输入结构的全部原子位点中随机删除原子，按整体数量或比例生成不同的空位构型。所有元素具有同等的位点采样资格；输出保留剩余原子的坐标、晶胞、PBC、逐原子数组和结构信息。"
msgstr ""
"Randomly remove atoms from all sites in the input structure to generate different "
"vacancy configurations using an overall count or fraction. Sites of every element are"
" equally eligible for sampling. The output preserves the coordinates, cell, PBC, per-"
"atom arrays, and structure metadata of the remaining atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:11
#: d27e392d737f4ba28247b56c2c86bf54
msgid "**全局空位：** 从所有位点共同采样。"
msgstr "**Global Vacancy:** sample from all sites together."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:12
#: 03afd289649843d1870866ef1d37f6ff
msgid "**定向空位：** 按元素和可选 `group` 限定候选位点。"
msgstr "**Targeted Vacancy:** restrict candidate sites by element and an optional `group`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:13
#: 0704591a0faf4b56b1e304faa3c04c1a
msgid "**随机占位：** 改变位点元素，不减少原子数。"
msgstr "**Random Occupancy:** change the element at a site without reducing the atom count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:15
#: daf85923ff904717a5c1f786088517cb
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:17
#: cd1ed3dcfb524c72a4b98badf8ce8962
#, python-brace-format
msgid "设输入结构有 $N$ 个原子。按数量设置时，解析值就是 $n_{\\max}$；按比例 $f$ 设置时，程序向下取整："
msgstr ""
"Let the input contain $N$ atoms. When using a count, the resolved value is "
"$n_{\\max}$. When using a fraction $f$, the program rounds down:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:19
#: 4b89fe5c38af43e9ae6728dbe36e0de8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_{\\max}=\\lfloor fN\\rfloor.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:23
#: 715162765e5d47adb251062b3cd78de7
#, python-brace-format
msgid "“固定”模式的每个输出都删除 $n_{\\max}$ 个原子；“变化”模式则为每个输出从整数闭区间 $[1,n_{\\max}]$ 抽取删除数。给定删除数 $n$ 时，共有"
msgstr ""
"In `Fixed` mode, every output removes $n_{\\max}$ atoms. In `Variable` mode, each "
"output draws its removal count from the closed integer interval $[1,n_{\\max}]$. For "
"a given removal count $n$, there are"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:25
#: c352537489054c85b232e784c4561543
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Omega_n=\\binom{N}{n}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:29
#: 730a6e5c0328451caa5bacd585bb8fdb
msgid "种不同的位点组合。结果按删除位点集合去重，并受“每个输入最大输出数”限制，因此实际输出数可能低于请求值。程序始终保留至少一个原子。"
msgstr ""
"distinct site combinations. Results are deduplicated by their sets of removed sites "
"and limited by `Maximum outputs per input`, so the actual output count may be lower "
"than requested. The program always retains at least one atom."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:31
#: d90f87e675af4cc7913e012b86fa5ea4
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:33
#: 04528a4a791547d7b03bc8258eb05c6a
msgid "一个 100 原子的超胞需要生成最多 50 个、每个含 5 个空位的构型："
msgstr ""
"Suppose a 100-atom supercell should produce at most 50 configurations, each "
"containing five vacancies:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:35
#: 42579785906e4f61893e10b843887722
msgid "“数量依据”选择“比例”，填写 `0.05`。"
msgstr "For `Quantity basis`, select `Fraction` and enter `0.05`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:36
#: 5e0fda18750140949b055489059f2ded
msgid "“每个输出的空位数”选择“固定”。"
msgstr "For `Vacancies per output`, select `Fixed`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:37
#: aede47e7b66045e9bb23580d7aad2c0e
msgid "“每个输入最大输出数”填写 `50`。"
msgstr "Set `Maximum outputs per input` to `50`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:38
#: 436176e07d4a4826bbd494c7a5d2213d
msgid "位点采样保持“均匀随机”。"
msgstr "Leave `Site sampling` set to `Uniform random`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:40
#: def40a173ada4ca9aaf736e62393e151
msgid "首帧预览会显示“删除 5 个原子”和唯一输出上限。若选择“变化”，每个输出会删除 1–5 个原子。"
msgstr ""
"The first-frame preview shows `Remove 5 atoms` and the upper bound on unique outputs."
" If `Variable` is selected, each output removes 1–5 atoms."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:42
#: e585c160dec9462ebbf5dcdf8fa86500
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:44
#: c4f831069a8e41c594efaadb88b6aaf7
msgid "空位数量（num_condition）"
msgstr "Vacancy count (`num_condition`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:46
#: 3f22ecafb7f84064bd03c91ccbe15d5c
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。数量依据为“数量”时使用；至少为 1，并且必须小于输入原子数。在“变化”模式下，它表示最大删除数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`. Used when the quantity basis is `Count`; it must be at least 1 "
"and smaller than the input atom count. In `Variable` mode, it is the maximum removal "
"count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:48
#: 535ce26a787f43d195f033032299580d
msgid "空位比例（concentration_condition）"
msgstr "Vacancy Fraction (concentration_condition)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:50
#: 3d01b71950c9453abd4c46f1d24acf1c
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 `0.01`，范围 `(0,1)`。数量依据为“比例”时使用。程序计算 `floor(N × fraction)`；结果为 0 "
"时会提示当前输入至少需要的比例。在“变化”模式下，换算结果是最大删除数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.01`, in the range `(0,1)`. Used when the quantity basis is "
"`Fraction`. The program computes `floor(N × fraction)`; if the result is zero, it "
"reports the minimum fraction required for the current input. In `Variable` mode, the "
"converted value is the maximum removal count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:52
#: 862bb7d046d0464ebbc900886cf220b0
msgid "数量依据（use_num）"
msgstr "Quantity Basis (use_num)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:54
#: d79173510fa84ad7a64a2d612e9f2aa9
msgid "`bool`，默认 `true`。界面中的“数量 / 比例”选择：`true` 使用绝对数量，`false` 使用整体比例。界面只显示当前生效的输入框。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `true`. This corresponds to the `Count / Fraction` choice in the "
"interface: `true` uses an absolute count and `false` uses an overall fraction. The "
"interface displays only the currently active input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:56
#: 8e5dd10cf9454e2a8109b5118cc6c0b6
msgid "每个输出的空位数（count_mode）"
msgstr "Vacancies per output (`count_mode`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:58
#: 31708afd7bb34a16bd06e7c36e23c0ce
msgid "`str`，默认 `fixed`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `fixed`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 66f4c5e506484197b47d85a5218f071e
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 2823e2315f7e451d90f5a750b1f8c6e0
msgid "每个输出删除数"
msgstr "Atoms Removed per Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 31708afd7bb34a16bd06e7c36e23c0ce
msgid "`fixed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 23dedf40043b491a95b1e0a41dd1ab36
msgid "固定为解析出的数量"
msgstr "Fixed at the resolved count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 3b302dade7f14cd6acfdbfc4e552a1f5
msgid "`random`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 1fdb9c027b05462687c37dad413c52be
msgid "从 1 到解析值之间随机抽取"
msgstr "Randomly drawn from 1 through the resolved value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:65
#: 722fe70a69714617a14328d2c447a2b1
msgid "每个输入最大输出数（max_structures）"
msgstr "Maximum outputs per input (`max_structures`)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:67
#: 7f71ff44a15541ba803e7c9b641cc6bf
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`，至少为 1。限制每个输入保留的唯一空位构型数；可用组合不足或随机抽样重复时，实际输出更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`, with a minimum of 1. Limits the number of unique vacancy "
"configurations retained for each input. The actual count is smaller when too few "
"combinations exist or random sampling produces duplicates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:69
#: 6ce18ccd34944def9e28a737eff25b2d
msgid "位点采样（engine_type）"
msgstr "Site Sampling (engine_type)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:71
#: 31708afd7bb34a16bd06e7c36e23c0ce
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: c19e7e3e9b324e9b808c64e43cc505e6
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: b5ef6c53f21a4fd0804d7e69b3695c51
msgid "方法"
msgstr "Method"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 6f66abf7d14a40bfb21f849c721d738d
msgid "适用情况"
msgstr "Suitable For"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 29ceb45ae0934887ac10d8719223942a
msgid "`1`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 2b16c26c3294471587beca599ded9b3d
msgid "Uniform"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 9455d665c4cd4e0f99f1ddcbb14ec8c7
msgid "通用默认，伪随机均匀采样"
msgstr "General default; uniform pseudorandom sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 13c8d368f32549c58bf701e7e7caddb5
msgid "`0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 12a3691b65464c9791c6458655b8a2b6
msgid "Sobol"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md
#: 8900714f85d74685902e582cd6f08326
msgid "准随机覆盖；输入最多 21,200 个原子"
msgstr "Quasirandom coverage; inputs are limited to 21,200 atoms"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:78
#: d60014d4c19742edb48978500f7687bc
msgid "两种方法只改变位点组合的抽样顺序，不改变候选范围。"
msgstr ""
"The two methods change only the order in which site combinations are sampled, not the"
" candidate set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:80
#: e16375ee6f87483599e187cb9a1c7a42
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:82
#: ca76e79fb2b942319c7fb2af33ef3229
msgid "`bool`，默认 `false`。开启后显示种子输入，并使相同输入与参数可复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. Enabling it reveals the seed input and makes identical "
"inputs and parameters reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:84
#: 630c3081e63b459f8d7914da4ed0feba
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:86
#: 77f9698755534fdabe1b529911d98caf
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时使用。种子会结合结构内容派生，因此数据集中的不同输入帧不会机械删除相同原子序号。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`, used only when `use_seed=true`. The seed is combined with the "
"structure content, so different input frames in a dataset do not mechanically remove "
"atoms with the same indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:88
#: b7d897d35d7048e590637281f31cdbf7
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:90
#: 109f04f3cf0f4f1da6f686b029e58208
msgid "`Super Cell → Global Vacancy`：先扩大晶胞，再生成空位。"
msgstr "`Super Cell → Global Vacancy`: enlarge the cell first, then generate vacancies."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:91
#: 907ad4877ab34800a65f649ad8e9f460
msgid "`Global Vacancy → FPS Filter`：从大量空位落点中筛选代表性构型。"
msgstr ""
"`Global Vacancy → FPS Filter`: select representative configurations from a large "
"collection of vacancy placements."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:92
#: d30b662e4d2e4336858cd6deab0b82bd
msgid "只删除特定元素或原子层时，使用 `Targeted Vacancy`。"
msgstr "Use `Targeted Vacancy` when removing only a particular element or atomic layer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:94
#: a4658bd6a5fc42859962a4d3e83610fd
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:96
#: 222430f7cf8042a18a5c38c7943d246e
msgid "**为什么比例 0.01 没有删除原子？** 对 $N$ 个原子的结构，至少需要 $f\\ge 1/N$，否则向下取整为 0。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a fraction of 0.01 remove no atoms?** For a structure with $N$ atoms, at "
"least $f\\ge 1/N$ is required; otherwise rounding down gives zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:98
#: 4f4fa7519b7e424a92275dc8f34d24aa
msgid "**为什么多元素结构的组分会变化？** 所有位点都参与抽样，某种元素被删除的概率与它在输入中的位点数有关。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the composition of a multielement structure change?** Every site "
"participates in sampling, so the probability of removing a given element is "
"proportional to its number of sites in the input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:100
#: 09e355ac5e8d47119f6c151e438be954
msgid "**为什么实际输出少于设置值？** 删除位点相同的结果会去重，小结构的唯一组合数也可能不足。"
msgstr ""
"**Why are there fewer outputs than requested?** Results with the same removed sites "
"are deduplicated, and a small structure may not have enough unique combinations."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:102
#: f3b6076d4d2441ef8e0cf0eda28f362c
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:104
#: 5964120c434d4c6b9ebde1cac87d6e07
msgid "每个结果的 `Config_type` 追加："
msgstr "The following is appended to `Config_type` for each result:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/vacancy-defect-card.md:106
#: d328bc79a1234118ab849290d3ec789c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Vac(n={实际删除原子数})\n"
msgstr "Vac(n={actual number of removed atoms})\n"

#~ msgid "空位缺陷生成（Vacancy Defect Generation）"
#~ msgstr "Vacancy Defect Generation"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "按数量或比例删除原子，快速生成低到高缺陷强度的空位结构分布。支持 Sobol / Uniform 两种随机引擎，可选"
#~ " count 或 fraction 两种主模式，并可选择固定空位数或随机空位数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Remove atoms by count or fraction to "
#~ "generate vacancy configurations over a range "
#~ "of defect concentrations. Choose Sobol or "
#~ "uniform sampling, count or fraction mode, and"
#~ " fixed or randomized vacancy counts."

#~ msgid "`Vacancy Defect Generation`：统计驱动，按整体比例/数量生成空位，适合快速覆盖空位密度分布"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Vacancy Defect Generation` is statistical: it "
#~ "samples global counts or fractions to cover"
#~ " a vacancy-density distribution."

#~ msgid "`Random Vacancy`：规则驱动，按元素+group 精确删除位点，适合定向研究"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Random Vacancy` is rule driven: it removes"
#~ " sites by element and group for targeted"
#~ " studies."

#~ msgid "操作示例"
#~ msgstr "Example workflow"

#~ msgid "场景：模型把空位构型全部预测成接近完美晶体"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: Vacancy configurations are predicted like a perfect crystal"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 100 原子的 Fe 超胞上训练了一个 NEP，训练集里只有弛豫好的完美晶体。模型推理一个含"
#~ " 1 个空位的构型时，能量几乎和完美晶体一样——模型没学过\"少了一个原子\"是什么后果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A NEP trained only on relaxed perfect "
#~ "100-atom Fe cells assigns nearly the same "
#~ "energy to a single-vacancy configuration "
#~ "because no vacancy-centered environments were "
#~ "labeled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 模型在完美晶体上收敛是因为训练集只有完美晶体。空位附近原子的力场完全不同：键断了一半，局域电子密度变化大。需要往训练集里加入从"
#~ " 1 个空位到 ~5% 浓度的分布，让模型覆盖低/中/高缺陷密度段。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Atoms adjacent to a vacancy "
#~ "have different coordination and forces. Add "
#~ "relaxed and labeled structures spanning single "
#~ "vacancies through the intended concentration range,"
#~ " rather than relying on perfect-crystal "
#~ "data."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个 100 原子的 Fe 超胞"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A 100-atom Fe supercell."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 用 fraction 模式生成 5% 空位浓度，每帧 50 个随机落点版本"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Generate 50 site arrangements at 5% vacancy fraction."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`Vacancy Fraction`：勾选"
#~ msgstr "Enable `Vacancy Fraction`."

#~ msgid "`Vacancy Fraction`：`[0.05]`（100 原子里精确删除 5 个空位）"
#~ msgstr "Set `Vacancy Fraction` to `[0.05]`, corresponding to five removed atoms here."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 50 个空位结构，每个都删除 5 个原子，但空位落点不同，带 `Vac(n=5)` 标签"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Fifty structures with five vacancies "
#~ "at different sites, labeled `Vac(n=5)`."

